OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds of tree deaths under
OL,4,Ainvestigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe death of hundreds of newly planted
OL,7,Ftrees on Hove seafront is being
OL,8,Finvestigated by Brighton and Hove City
OL,9,FCouncil.
OL,11,FA planning application to plant
OL,12,Freplacement trees could be in the
OL,13,Fpipeline once the local authority has
OL,14,Fworked out how to prevent a repeat of
OL,15,Fso many trees dying, according to the
OL,16,FLocal Democracy Reporting Service.
OL,18,FThe incident may even lead to
OL,19,Fenforcement action ` although the
OL,20,Fcouncil was the applicant in the first
OL,21,Finstance, it added.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
